# Build context for util/dql_chat.Dockerfile. BuildKit uses this file instead
# of the root .dockerignore (which keeps .github out of the MCP image). An
# allow-list: everything is excluded, then the few paths the chat needs.
*
!dt_fetch.py
!docs/
!util/
!.github/agents/dql-expert.md
util/dt_trace_profiler*
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
